WindFox Studio
==============

Design reference
----------------
The layout, spacing, sizes and control patterns of this app's UI follow the
WinUI 3 Gallery (https://github.com/microsoft/WinUI-Gallery), and the color
tokens come from microsoft-ui-xaml
(controls/dev/CommonStyles/Common_themeresources_any.xaml). No code, images
or logos from those projects are included; the measurements and token values
were re-implemented in CSS.

